# Scratch-tier exports that landed at repo root instead of the registered
# data_manifest.toml path (e.g. when the scratch disk wasn't mounted) --
# real output belongs on the scratch tier, never here. Scoped to this one
# subpath, not all of trifecta/: trifecta/gijsbert/*.jsonl are tracked fixtures.
